     "\r\n  \r\n\r\n    \r\n  \r\n  <div text=\"#000000\" bgcolor=\"#FFFFFF\">\r\n    <p>Distance for Windows users:</p>\r\n    <p>Version 7.1 is now available for download at <br>\r\n    </p>\r\n    <p><a href=\"http://distancesampling.org/Distance/index.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://distancesampling.org/Distance/index.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792475007292000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2IWPsyiLVixZYz5VOx1sMf\">http://distancesampling.org/Distance/index.html</a>  <br>\r\n    </p>\r\n    <p>While at the site, look around for other interesting items.</p>\r\n    <p>This is the version of the software we will be using at our\r\n      intermediate distance sampling workshop at the end of this month\r\n      (places still available for attendees travelling to St Andrews),\r\n      see <br>\r\n    </p>\r\n    <p><a href=\"https://creem2.st-andrews.ac.uk/intermediate-level-distance-sampling-training-workshop-2017/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://creem2.st-andrews.ac.uk/intermediate-level-distance-sampling-training-workshop-2017/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792475007292000&amp;usg=AOvVaw36Jdfsj2gtnsTAbGVq9PHX\">https://creem2.st-andrews.ac.uk/intermediate-level-distance-sampling-training-workshop-2017/</a></p>\r\n    <p>New/improved features of the software:</p>\r\n    <ul>\r\n      <li>simulation engine can accommodate clusters and covariates in\r\n        the detection function</li>\r\n      <li>density surface modelling adds more variance estimation\r\n        methods, additional response distributions and uncertainty\r\n        surface plots</li>\r\n      <li>lots of other enhancements and improvements<br>\r\n      </li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n    <pre cols=\"72\">-- \r\nEric Rexstad\r\nResearch Unit for Wildlife Population Assessment\r\nCentre for Research into Ecological and Environmental Modelling\r\nUniversity of St. Andrews\r\nSt. Andrews Scotland KY16 9LZ\r\n<a href=\"tel:+44%201334%20461833\" value=\"+441334461833\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">+44 (0)1334 461833</a>\r\nThe University of St Andrews is a charity registered in Scotland : No SC013532\t\t</pre>\r\n  <div><br>\r\n<table style=\"border-top:1px solid #d3d4de\">\r\n\t<tr>\r\n        <td style=\"width:55px;padding-top:13px\"><a href=\"https://www.avast.com/sig-email?utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=link&amp;utm_campaign=sig-email&amp;utm_content=emailclient\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.avast.com/sig-email?utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_source%3Dlink%26utm_campaign%3Dsig-email%26utm_content%3Demailclient&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792475007292000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3rbwFvHennIOtgQJujEhHr\"><img src=\"https://ci3.googleusercontent.com/proxy/IAkhl6EbYbQYD9J_1Dc6N_HPU5Z488DnGcKcnWpOKuYmchAYVxkuaNLcLza-a4lma2s9ti4CdivC6ngcOg6DxsKIfQSj1jUPE23T-RPW6SSIBxsEZEVz9o7f4AeRul4zwq6JNmxjsa05TVZzHfERYYI-=s0-d-e1-ft#https://ipmcdn.avast.com/images/icons/icon-envelope-tick-round-orange-animated-no-repeat-v1.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"29\" style=\"width:46px;min-height:29px\"></a></td>\r\n\t\t<td style=\"width:470px;padding-top:12px;color:#41424e;font-size:13px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:18px\">Virus-free. <a href=\"https://www.avast.com/sig-email?utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=link&amp;utm_campaign=sig-email&amp;utm_content=emailclient\" style=\"color:#4453ea\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.avast.com/sig-email?utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_source%3Dlink%26utm_campaign%3Dsig-email%26utm_content%3Demailclient&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792475007292000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3rbwFvHennIOtgQJujEhHr\">www.avast.com</a>\r\n\t\t</td>\r\n\t</tr>\r\n</table><a href=\"#m_6502214901727050704_DAB4FAD8-2DD7-40BB-A1B8-4E2AA1F9FDF2\" width=\"1\" height=\"1\" rel=\"nofollow\"> </a